    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div><h2>Calculated Risk</h2><p><em>You open yourself on purpose.</em></p><hr><h3>Rules</h3><p>Once per turn, you may choose to reroll the lowest die on an attack roll. If you do, attack rolls against you reroll the lowest die until the start of your next turn.</p><p class=\"ft-engine-note\"><em>🃏 Card — once per turn: banks a reroll for your attack; attacks against you reroll their lowest die until your next turn (GM applies).</em></p>",
